From 9c46c004281296da068ca19d0241e35977eb4387 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 00:57:07 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] amd-event-log: add Redfish projection support

Introduce AMD OEM Redfish projection support for AEL
runtime metadata.

Add a reusable Redfish projection framework capable of
translating AEL metadata fields such as AEL.AFID and
AEL.FRU_LIST into AMD OEM Redfish payloads.

Support producer-supplied Redfish payloads through the
AEL.REDFISH field. When present, the payload is treated
as authoritative and bypasses automatic projection.

Update the runtime metadata provider to generate the
final AMD OEM payload during log creation and store the
projected Redfish representation under the AMD
namespace.

Add unit tests covering metadata projection, FRU
processing, AFID translation, and passthrough behavior.

Tested:
'''
busctl --json=pretty call xyz.openbmc_project.Logging /xyz/openbmc_project/logging/entry/3 org.freedesktop.DBus.Properties GetAll   s xyz.openbmc_project.Logging.Extension.CPERProcessed
{
        "type" : "a{sv}",
        "data" : [
                {
                        "DiagnosticDataType" : {
                                "type" : "s",
                                "data" : "xyz.openbmc_project.CPER.Types.ContentType.CPER"
                        },
                        "NotificationType" : {
                                "type" : "s",
                                "data" : ""
                        },
                        "SectionType" : {
                                "type" : "s",
                                "data" : ""
                        },
                        "Oem" : {
                                "type" : "a{ss}",
                                "data" : {
                                        "AMD" : "{\"@odata.type\":\"#AMD_Message.v1_0_0.AMD_Message\",\"AMDFieldIdentifiers\":[{\"AFID\":8,\"Description\":\"Unknown Error\",\"ServiceableUnits\":[{\"InventoryPath\":\"/xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/Board/XYZ\"}],\"ServiceableUnits@odata.count\":1}],\"AMDFieldIdentifiers@odata.count\":1,\"RackUnitPosition\":\"AMD:RACK_ID\"}"
                                }
                        }
                }
        ]
}
'''

